From 83638a1b0b00f228966e9b96912039a9bb12be18 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: permissionBRICK <40219477+permissionBRICK@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 16:17:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): unsaved settings are never lost without asking

Moving the threshold slider and closing the app lost the change: the
page saves only on Save, at the top of a long page. While the form has
unsaved changes a bar at the bottom offers Save and Reset, and closing
the window (Tauri's close-requested event; core:window:allow-destroy to
close afterwards) or leaving the page (the router's blocker) asks to
save, discard or stay. Save goes through the form's checks and closes
or leaves only once it saved.
