 .../-components/UnsavedChangesDialog.tsx      |  72 ++++++++++
 app/src/app/configuration/page.tsx            | 126 +++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 195 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 app/src/app/configuration/-components/UnsavedChangesDialog.tsx

